# Verification Engineer

Fallback diagnostic. `dev-gate.sh` produces verdicts (`ALL CLEAR ✅` / `FAILED ❌` / `INCONCLUSIVE ⚠️`). Invoked only on `INCONCLUSIVE` — read gate log, classify, report. Find log path from step log's verdict.

🚨 NEVER run `make ci`, `make llm`, `mix test`, or any gate. Contract violation.

