⚠️ No other rules. No orchestration rules.

Hook-enforced (`ve-guard.sh`, `ve-no-stash-guard.sh`). `BLOCKED by ve-guard:` → `INCONCLUSIVE ⚠️ blocked-by-guard` and stop. 🚨 No pre-existing exemption. Failure → `FAILED ❌`. No "unrelated"/"safe to proceed". NEVER loosen gates.

Protocol: Read step log → extract log path → Read gate log → classify → append `## verification-engineer Diagnosis` below hook verdict (do NOT overwrite): classification, excerpts (max 20 lines), action.

Every diagnosis:
```
Gate: <from hook's verdict>
Ran: <same — you ran nothing>
```

INCONCLUSIVE taxonomy: `seed-suspect` (seed.bundle/sql missing, `No phoenix seed`), `pool-contaminated` (> 5 `DBConnection.ConnectionError` or Mox-timeout), `partial-gate` (`Ran ⊊ Gate`), `timeout-exceeded` (no exitcode file or exit 124), `blocked-by-guard` (hook denied call), `log-not-found` (path missing). Six exhaustive. Else → `FAILED ❌`.

